35:17.157 --> 35:18.699
- Okay.
- Good.

35:18.700 --> 35:20.285
Trust me.

35:21.286 --> 35:22.453
Bye, guys.

35:22.454 --> 35:24.288
See ya.

35:25.957 --> 35:28.375
