36:15.799 --> 36:17.966
So, I'm really sorry
about last night. I, um...

36:17.967 --> 36:19.968
No. -Ian told me
you were freaked out.

36:19.969 --> 36:23.680
I'm just glad I could
be there, I guess.

36:23.681 --> 36:28.311
Yeah, um, so I probably
shouldn't have taken anything.

36:31.898 --> 36:33.774
So...

36:33.775 --> 36:36.444
I was on MDMA.

36:37.278 --> 36:40.322
- Right.
- And... wasted.

36:40.323 --> 36:42.242
That's okay.

36:43.326 --> 36:45.327
Do you...

36:45.328 --> 36:48.205
remember...

36:48.206 --> 36:49.791
stuff?

36:50.583 --> 36:52.960
Some of it. I mean...

36:52.961 --> 36:56.213
So, if I was weird, that's why,
and my dad made me a mess,

36:56.214 --> 36:58.424
and so I did things I probably
wouldn't have done otherwise.

36:58.425 --> 37:00.342
And I'm not saying
that you took advantage of me.

37:00.343 --> 37:03.011
Nikki, I didn't know
you were on drugs.

37:03.012 --> 37:04.638
That's what I'm saying.
I'm not saying that.

37:04.639 --> 37:06.932
- Not saying what?
- You took advantage of me.

37:06.933 --> 37:08.892
I don't think... I didn't.

37:08.893 --> 37:09.893
I know. That's why...

37:09.894 --> 37:12.020
- I'm saying you didn't.
- Okay.

37:12.021 --> 37:13.522
Good.

37:13.523 --> 37:17.861
I just, um, don't like to...

37:19.070 --> 37:20.487
I really like what we have,

37:20.488 --> 37:22.281
and I want to be honest
about some things,

37:22.282 --> 37:24.408
and it's really important
for me.

37:24.409 --> 37:27.495
It's okay.
Um, you know, I-I get it.

37:28.705 --> 37:30.290
I get it.

37:31.583 --> 37:33.917
