38:04.032 --> 38:06.575
Started during Christmas, and...

38:06.576 --> 38:08.285
I don't know, it just...

38:08.286 --> 38:10.788
Then, last night,
I saw what we could...

38:16.794 --> 38:18.755
Do you have feelings for me?

38:27.847 --> 38:29.515
Yeah, I do.

39:20.692 --> 39:23.443
And I wrote, "In a band,"
and then she made me change it.

39:23.444 --> 39:24.945
- Yeah.
- Bitch.

39:24.946 --> 39:26.905
