a four-course meal,

40:29.093 --> 40:30.969
and I'll pull out my wallet,
and they'll say,

40:30.970 --> 40:33.555
"No, no, no, sir, please,
tonight, on the house."

40:33.556 --> 40:34.765
And then I get paid.

40:34.766 --> 40:36.516
Is that how that goes?

40:36.517 --> 40:38.518
I actually don't know.

40:38.519 --> 40:40.520
Okay, my little food critic,

40:40.521 --> 40:41.772
what's the verdict
on this bread?

40:41.773 --> 40:43.482
- This bread?
- Mm-hmm.

40:43.483 --> 40:44.858
Oh.

40:44.859 --> 40:46.736
Well...

40:49.030 --> 40:52.616
Hmm. Slightly stale, but the
butter makes up for that shit.

40:52.617 --> 40:54.493
- Profound.
- That'll be a hundred dollars.

40:54.494 --> 40:55.744
Well...

40:55.745 --> 40:57.747
Sorry.

40:59.040 --> 41:00.666
It's the second time
he's called.

41:00.667 --> 41:02.001
I'll be right back.

41:03.002 --> 41:06.004
- What is it, dude? I'm busy.
- Oh, busy doing Nikki?

41:06.005 --> 41:07.339
What do you want?

41:07.340 --> 41:09.966
Okay, so, um...

41:09.967 --> 41:11.677
What is it?

41:11.678 --> 41:13.136
I'm not gonna tell Sarah
about this,

41:13.137 --> 41:16.056
