to spread drama.

41:16.057 --> 41:18.975
I looked into Nikki's dad
having cancer,

41:18.976 --> 41:21.478
and he's healthy as a baby.

41:21.479 --> 41:23.815
He's been to work,
like, every day.

41:29.904 --> 41:31.697
