she just thought of you

41:48.840 --> 41:51.258
like her little brother
or, you know,

41:51.259 --> 41:52.551
and she, like, friend-zoned you.

41:52.552 --> 41:54.594
And-and-and look,
that may suck to hear,

41:54.595 --> 41:56.304
but I just think
you got to know because,

41:56.305 --> 41:58.807
I-I don't know, I think she has
some kind of ill intentions

41:58.808 --> 42:01.268
or something freaking mental
is going on, man.

42:01.269 --> 42:03.019
And maybe Sarah's jealous
and made that up,

42:03.020 --> 42:05.731
but, like, even if you take
that out of the equation,

42:05.732 --> 42:08.859
this is strange, dude.

42:08.860 --> 42:11.111
It's like Nikki snapped
into a different person.

42:11.112 --> 42:14.030
Sh-She's all of a sudden
infatuated with you.

42:30.047 --> 42:31.883
Everything okay?

42:37.764 --> 42:40.224
Nikki, do you...

42:42.185 --> 42:44.145
