43:30.691 --> 43:34.736
Bear, I love you
so, so, so, so, so much.

43:34.737 --> 43:37.114
I don't think I could live
without you.

43:41.619 --> 43:44.622
You love me more
than anyone in the world?

43:48.626 --> 43:51.087
Yes, more than anyone.

43:54.465 --> 43:55.925
Nikki.

43:57.093 --> 43:58.760
Yeah?

43:58.761 --> 44:00.762
Does your dad
really have cancer?

44:15.319 --> 44:16.696
No.

44:20.116 --> 44:22.659
No, no, no.

44:22.660 --> 44:23.785
What?

44:23.786 --> 44:25.745
No, no, no,

44:25.746 --> 44:28.081
- no, no, no, no, no.
- What?

44:28.082 --> 44:29.791
- Don't do that!
- Nikki.

44:29.792 --> 44:32.335
I thought we were having a
nice date. -

44:32.336 --> 44:34.170
- We-we are. We are. Sit down.
- Why does it matter?

44:34.171 --> 44:37.632
I thought we were having
a nice date. -We are. We are.

44:37.633 --> 44:39.467
We are. We are.

44:39.468 --> 44:41.595
It's okay.

44:41.596 --> 44:44.098
We are. We are.

44:53.941 --> 44:55.985
