45:03.951 --> 45:05.493
It doesn't matter to me.

45:05.494 --> 45:08.038
Oh, yeah.

45:11.959 --> 45:14.837
Yeah. Uh-huh.

45:21.302 --> 45:23.930
- Oh, that was amazing, baby.
- Yeah.

45:26.766 --> 45:28.351
Yeah.

46:00.549 --> 46:02.051
Nikki?

46:16.399 --> 46:18.859
Go back to sleep.

46:20.069 --> 46:21.779
Nikki.

46:26.158 --> 46:28.202
What are you doing?

46:33.958 --> 46:35.959
What are you doing?

46:35.960 --> 46:37.920
Watching you sleep.

46:38.796 --> 46:40.881
You're so cute when you sleep.

46:43.050 --> 46:44.634
Wearing my sweater, huh?

46:44.635 --> 46:46.303
Smells like you.

46:50.266 --> 46:52.893
- Can you come back to bed?
- No, no.

46:58.566 --> 47:00.151
- Nikki.
- No.

47:04.196 --> 47:07.158
I don't like my dreams.

47:16.625 --> 47:21.212
I feel like you don't love me
as much as I do.

47:21.213 --> 47:26.010
Like it's not mutual.

47:26.844 --> 47:29.345
No, I... I do.

47:29.346 --> 47:32.307
Just come back to bed.

47:32.308 --> 47:34.018
Please?

47:41.901 --> 47:44.611
Go back to sleep.

48:09.386 --> 48:13.223
Why don't you love me?!

48:13.224 --> 48:16.102
Nikki? Nikki, where are you?

48:24.693 --> 48:26.153
What?

48:31.075 --> 48:33.244
Nikki, what are you doing?

48:37.540 --> 48:39.083
Nikki.

48:41.252 --> 48:43.379
