want me to do?

48:44.672 --> 48:46.382
For Sandy, okay?

49:13.868 --> 49:16.453
Stay!

49:36.140 --> 49:38.058
What the fuck?

49:50.988 --> 49:53.115
- Morning.
- Morning.

49:58.829 --> 50:00.580
Um...

50:00.581 --> 50:01.999
