50:05.085 --> 50:07.754
Did you cut my hair?

50:07.755 --> 50:09.173
Yeah.

50:13.344 --> 50:16.138
Let's not do that.

50:21.685 --> 50:23.270
Okay.

50:28.275 --> 50:30.401
Packed you a lunch.

50:30.402 --> 50:31.569
Oh.

50:32.738 --> 50:36.199
Oh, oh, can-can we talk
about last night?

50:36.200 --> 50:39.869
I know. I know.

50:39.870 --> 50:41.162
It was kind of weird.

50:41.163 --> 50:42.372
Right?

50:42.373 --> 50:44.667
Yeah. I'm so sorry.

50:45.834 --> 50:48.211
Okay, good,
'cause if I'm being honest,

50:48.212 --> 50:49.837
it was kind of terrifying.

50:49.838 --> 50:51.173
Oh, my God.

50:51.924 --> 50:54.384
I'm so sorry.

50:54.385 --> 50:57.638
I had a bad dream, and I just...

51:03.102 --> 51:05.437
