51:38.178 --> 51:40.096
I love you.

51:40.097 --> 51:41.849
I love you, too.

51:42.599 --> 51:44.934
- So, so, so, so...
- Okay, okay, okay, okay.

51:44.935 --> 51:47.603
Good. Good.

51:47.604 --> 51:49.939
