something?

51:49.940 --> 51:51.274
Yes.

51:51.275 --> 51:53.735
No more weird stuff.

51:53.736 --> 51:55.236
All right?

51:55.237 --> 51:56.988
No more watching me
while I sleep

51:56.989 --> 51:59.282
or, like, moving weird.

51:59.283 --> 52:01.075
