52:02.494 --> 52:05.289
and I'm so sorry
that it even happened.

52:11.587 --> 52:12.503
Okay.

52:12.504 --> 52:14.047
- Okay.
- So...

52:14.048 --> 52:15.715
- we're good.
- We're good.

52:15.716 --> 52:17.175
We're good.

52:17.176 --> 52:19.135
- Great.
- Great.

52:20.179 --> 52:21.637
We're good.

52:21.638 --> 52:23.097
All right.

52:23.098 --> 52:26.059
Oh, God, I'm gonna miss you.

52:26.060 --> 52:28.644
I wish I was scheduled today.

52:29.646 --> 52:31.981
No, no, just enjoy your day off.

52:33.984 --> 52:35.818
Maybe I can pop by.

52:35.819 --> 52:38.489
No, no, just make yourself
at home.

52:39.281 --> 52:40.824
Love you.

52:42.326 --> 52:43.993
Love you.

53:09.728 --> 53:11.562
If you're having trouble
with the door,

53:11.563 --> 53:13.064
maybe you should just stay home.

53:13.065 --> 53:14.982
No, I got it.

53:20.948 --> 53:22.156
Bye, Bear.

54:41.153 --> 54:44.113
Why-why is everyone
so entitled these days?

54:44.114 --> 54:45.531
Like, people have no patience.

54:45.532 --> 54:48.534
It's... it was so clear
I was busy,

54:48.535 --> 54:50.328
and they won't stop
pestering me.

54:50.329 --> 54:52.581
What the fuck is that?

54:53.540 --> 54:55.792
Inside joke.

55:02.841 --> 55:05.302
You going
to Ian's thing tonight?

55:07.054 --> 55:09.055
First I've heard.

55:09.056 --> 55:10.807
Well...

55:13.143 --> 55:14.728
"Well," what?

55:21.652 --> 55:24.487
I heard what you told Ian.

55:24.488 --> 55:26.531
About what?

55:26.532 --> 55:28.492
About Nikki.

55:29.409 --> 55:30.952
How she friend-zoned me.

55:30.953 --> 55:32.828
I don't know what Nikki said
in the past, but...

55:32.829 --> 55:35.415
I mean, we literally
talked about it once.

55:37.167 --> 55:39.001
I just think that it's weird

55:39.002 --> 55:41.462
how you two are dating
all of a sudden.

55:41.463 --> 55:42.672
Like, super dating.

55:42.673 --> 55:44.340
I don't know, Sarah.

55:44.341 --> 55:46.842
Look, I couldn't care less
whatever game Nikki is playing.

55:46.843 --> 55:48.678
I just don't want you
to get hurt and...

55:48.679 --> 55:50.221
What is your problem
with Nikki? -No, and if

55:50.222 --> 55:51.806
Ian's gonna spread my shit,
then you should know,

55:51.807 --> 55:53.100
- Ian and...
- Honey.

55:54.101 --> 55:55.852
We got another one.

56:00.274 --> 56:01.649
God, I'm nervous.

56:01.650 --> 56:04.068
Please, God.

56:04.069 --> 56:05.404
Please.

56:08.073 --> 56:09.449
No.

56:10.200 --> 56:13.661
Well, you got to get in
somewhere, or else...

56:13.662 --> 56:15.747
- I know.
- You know?

56:16.873 --> 56:18.124
Okay.

56:18.125 --> 56:19.876
Get back to work.

56:38.020 --> 56:40.229
This is what I get
for being such a fucker

56:40.230 --> 56:41.940
