56:48.405 --> 56:52.075
Is that your... the last one?

56:53.285 --> 56:55.536
No, one more.

56:55.537 --> 56:57.080
Luther.

57:11.470 --> 57:13.722
You can give me a tattoo
without a school.

57:14.931 --> 57:16.182
Thanks.

57:16.183 --> 57:18.559
It has to be small,
in a hidden location.

57:21.521 --> 57:23.607
Your lunch smells weird.

57:27.486 --> 57:29.278
- Oops.
- Jesus.

57:29.279 --> 57:31.197
"My little food critic."

57:31.198 --> 57:33.324
- What are you doing?
- "My little food critic."

57:35.911 --> 57:38.622
Well, what's the verdict on cat?

57:39.998 --> 57:41.457
What?

57:41.458 --> 57:43.626
What does that mean?

57:43.627 --> 57:45.629
"What's the verdict: cat?"

57:52.302 --> 57:54.471
Bear, what's that mean?

57:55.722 --> 57:57.431
That is so fucking weird.

58:00.936 --> 58:02.854
Bear, what does that mean?

58:05.524 --> 58:07.109
What?

58:08.151 --> 58:09.820
Bear, what is it?

58:11.488 --> 58:13.907
What the fuck is wrong with you?

58:14.950 --> 58:17.326
Are-are-are you okay?
Bear, what...

58:17.327 --> 58:18.703
Oh, my God.

58:18.704 --> 58:20.830
- Bear, are you okay?
- What's going on?

58:20.831 --> 58:22.540
